{
  "book": "mosiah",
  "bookName": "Mosiah",
  "chapter": 25,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 303.559,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.412,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now king Mosiah caused that all the people should be gathered together.",
      "verse": "25:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.092,
      "end": 7.971,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now there were not so many of the children of Nephi,",
      "verse": "25:2",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 8.151,
      "end": 11.309,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or so many of those who were descendants of Nephi,",
      "verse": "25:2",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 11.489,
      "end": 14.136,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as there were of the people of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "25:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 14.316,
      "end": 16.545,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who was a descendant of Mulek,",
      "verse": "25:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 16.725,
      "end": 20.069,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and those who came with him into the wilderness.",
      "verse": "25:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 20.749,
      "end": 24.0,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there were not so many of the people of Nephi",
      "verse": "25:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 24.18,
      "end": 26.13,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and of the people of Zarahemla",
      "verse": "25:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 26.31,
      "end": 28.725,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as there were of the Lamanites;",
      "verse": "25:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 28.905,
      "end": 31.088,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, they were not half so numerous.",
      "verse": "25:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 31.768,
      "end": 34.926,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now all the people of Nephi were assembled together,",
      "verse": "25:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 35.106,
      "end": 37.335,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also all the people of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "25:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 37.515,
      "end": 40.534,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were gathered together in two bodies.",
      "verse": "25:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 41.214,
      "end": 48.134,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Mosiah did read, and caused to be read, the records of Zeniff to his people;",
      "verse": "25:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 48.314,
      "end": 54.955,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, he read the records of the people of Zeniff, from the time they left the land of Zarahemla until they returned again.",
      "verse": "25:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 55.635,
      "end": 57.864,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he also read the account of Alma",
      "verse": "25:6",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 58.044,
      "end": 59.437,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his brethren,",
      "verse": "25:6",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 59.617,
      "end": 65.654,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all their afflictions, from the time they left the land of Zarahemla until the time they returned again.",
      "verse": "25:6",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 66.334,
      "end": 70.003,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, when Mosiah had made an end of reading the records,",
      "verse": "25:7",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 70.183,
      "end": 75.199,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "his people who tarried in the land were struck with wonder and amazement.",
      "verse": "25:7",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 75.879,
      "end": 77.829,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For they knew not what to think;",
      "verse": "25:8",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 78.009,
      "end": 82.374,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for when they beheld those that had been delivered out of bondage",
      "verse": "25:8",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 82.554,
      "end": 85.062,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were filled with exceedingly great joy.",
      "verse": "25:8",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 85.742,
      "end": 88.853,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again, when they thought of their brethren",
      "verse": "25:9",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 89.033,
      "end": 91.401,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had been slain by the Lamanites",
      "verse": "25:9",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 91.581,
      "end": 93.346,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were filled with sorrow,",
      "verse": "25:9",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 93.526,
      "end": 95.476,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and even shed many tears of sorrow.",
      "verse": "25:9",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 96.156,
      "end": 100.475,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again, when they thought of the immediate goodness of God, and his power",
      "verse": "25:10",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 100.655,
      "end": 106.321,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in delivering Alma and his brethren out of the hands of the Lamanites and of bondage,",
      "verse": "25:10",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 106.501,
      "end": 109.334,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they did raise their voices and give thanks to God.",
      "verse": "25:10",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 110.014,
      "end": 117.259,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again, when they thought upon the Lamanites, who were their brethren, of their sinful and polluted state,",
      "verse": "25:11",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 117.439,
      "end": 120.922,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were filled with pain and anguish for the welfare of their souls.",
      "verse": "25:11",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 121.602,
      "end": 126.478,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that those who were the children of Amulon and his brethren,",
      "verse": "25:12",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 126.658,
      "end": 130.187,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had taken to wife the daughters of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "25:12",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 130.367,
      "end": 133.432,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "were displeased with the conduct of their fathers,",
      "verse": "25:12",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 133.612,
      "end": 138.117,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they would no longer be called by the names of their fathers,",
      "verse": "25:12",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 138.297,
      "end": 141.223,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they took upon themselves the name of Nephi,",
      "verse": "25:12",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 141.403,
      "end": 144.607,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might be called the children of Nephi",
      "verse": "25:12",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 144.787,
      "end": 147.852,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be numbered among those who were called Nephites.",
      "verse": "25:12",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 148.532,
      "end": 152.897,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now all the people of Zarahemla were numbered with the Nephites,",
      "verse": "25:13",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 153.077,
      "end": 156.328,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this because the kingdom had been conferred upon none",
      "verse": "25:13",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 156.508,
      "end": 158.691,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but those who were descendants of Nephi.",
      "verse": "25:13",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 159.371,
      "end": 165.78,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that when Mosiah had made an end of speaking and reading to the people,",
      "verse": "25:14",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 165.96,
      "end": 169.071,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he desired that Alma should also speak to the people.",
      "verse": "25:14",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 169.751,
      "end": 171.841,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Alma did speak unto them,",
      "verse": "25:15",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 172.021,
      "end": 175.132,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when they were assembled together in large bodies,",
      "verse": "25:15",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 175.312,
      "end": 181.163,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he went from one body to another, preaching unto the people repentance and faith on the Lord.",
      "verse": "25:15",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 181.843,
      "end": 184.908,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he did exhort the people of Limhi and his brethren,",
      "verse": "25:16",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 185.088,
      "end": 188.153,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "all those that had been delivered out of bondage,",
      "verse": "25:16",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 188.333,
      "end": 192.234,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they should remember that it was the Lord that did deliver them.",
      "verse": "25:16",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 192.914,
      "end": 196.769,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after Alma had taught the people many things,",
      "verse": "25:17",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 196.949,
      "end": 199.364,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had made an end of speaking to them,",
      "verse": "25:17",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 199.544,
      "end": 203.213,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that king Limhi was desirous that he might be baptized;",
      "verse": "25:17",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 203.393,
      "end": 207.155,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all his people were desirous that they might be baptized also.",
      "verse": "25:17",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 207.835,
      "end": 212.618,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, Alma did go forth into the water and did baptize them;",
      "verse": "25:18",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 212.798,
      "end": 217.488,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, he did baptize them after the manner he did his brethren in the waters of Mormon;",
      "verse": "25:18",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 217.668,
      "end": 222.08,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and as many as he did baptize did belong to the church of God;",
      "verse": "25:18",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 222.26,
      "end": 225.418,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this because of their belief on the words of Alma.",
      "verse": "25:18",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 226.098,
      "end": 229.72,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that king Mosiah granted unto Alma",
      "verse": "25:19",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 229.9,
      "end": 234.08,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might establish churches throughout all the land of Zarahemla;",
      "verse": "25:19",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 234.26,
      "end": 239.508,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and gave him power to ordain priests and teachers over every church.",
      "verse": "25:19",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 240.188,
      "end": 243.067,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this was done because there were so many people",
      "verse": "25:20",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 243.247,
      "end": 246.637,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they could not all be governed by one teacher;",
      "verse": "25:20",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 246.817,
      "end": 250.346,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither could they all hear the word of God in one assembly;",
      "verse": "25:20",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 251.026,
      "end": 256.599,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore they did assemble themselves together in different bodies, being called churches;",
      "verse": "25:21",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 256.779,
      "end": 260.03,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every church having their priests and their teachers,",
      "verse": "25:21",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 260.21,
      "end": 262.346,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and every priest preaching the word",
      "verse": "25:21",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 262.526,
      "end": 265.916,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "according as it was delivered to him by the mouth of Alma.",
      "verse": "25:21",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 266.596,
      "end": 269.94,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus, notwithstanding there being many churches",
      "verse": "25:22",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 270.12,
      "end": 273.882,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were all one church, yea, even the church of God;",
      "verse": "25:22",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 274.062,
      "end": 277.173,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for there was nothing preached in all the churches",
      "verse": "25:22",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 277.353,
      "end": 279.861,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except it were repentance and faith in God.",
      "verse": "25:22",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 280.541,
      "end": 284.024,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now there were seven churches in the land of Zarahemla.",
      "verse": "25:23",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 284.204,
      "end": 293.864,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that whosoever were desirous to take upon them the name of Christ, or of God, they did join the churches of God;",
      "verse": "25:23",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 294.544,
      "end": 296.587,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they were called the people of God.",
      "verse": "25:24",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 296.767,
      "end": 299.739,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lord did pour out his Spirit upon them,",
      "verse": "25:24",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 299.919,
      "end": 302.891,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were blessed, and prospered in the land.",
      "verse": "25:24",
      "lineIndex": 78
    }
  ]
}